# Transfigure is activated "only as a sorcery" (CR 702.71a, 602.5d), and it is an ability of a permanent: Fleshwrither's {1}{B}{B}
# is paid for with three Moxen that stay untapped (two Mox Jets and a Mox Ruby for the generic), and is not offered while
# Fleshwrither is a card in the hand, nor on Bot2's turn, nor on Bot1's own while a spell (a Memnite) is on the stack. Once the
# Memnite has resolved, in Bot1's main phase with the stack empty, the same activation is offered and finds the Hero of
# Bladehold, the one creature card of the library with mana value 4.

